    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25717.png",
      "text": "ቀደም ኣብ ሓደ ዓዲ ኣንበሳ፣ ብዃርያ፣ ወዓግን ዝብእን ብሓባር ይነብሩ ነይሮም፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:0b50655ddb20b37fff5559eff2642c18012e76c0019b0a8c06b1773438cf73cc"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25718.png",
      "text": "ብሓባር እንትነብሩ ወዓግን ዝብእን ብዃርያ ንምጥፋእ ተንኮል ሓሰቡ ፡፡ ንኣያ ኣንበሳ ድማ ብሚስጥር ረኺቦም ኣዘራረብዎ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:0fae6d10f430a1155c5b394f6da318c5de5c69467f4e963dc1e7abbd649ec246"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25719.png",
      "text": "ወዓግን ዝብእን ናብ ኣያ ኣንበሳ ቀሪቦም ፣\" ኣያ ኣንበሳ፥ ንስኻ ብጣዕሚ ክቡር ኢኻ ፡፡ ክሳብ ሎሚ ግና ስለ ምንታይ ብዘይ ጫማ ትጓዓዝ ኣለኻ?\" በልዎ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:3a2f63f964e861c1288b68ac9f8e26e916bdb0b6c28ab632e84ddd3748dd1b3f"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25720.png",
      "text": "ኣያ ኣንበሳ ድማ ዝበልዎ ሰሚዑ ፣\" እሞ ኣነ ጫማ የድልየኒ ነይሩ፣ ሓቅኹም ፤ግና መን ይሰርሓለይ?\" ክብል ሓተቶም፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:27eac047cf32844de82cb3d47c239fab42e6e5375e010b39e00abf4ed1d60bec"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25721.png",
      "text": "ወዓግ ኣስዕብ ኣቢሉ ፣\" ኣያ ኣንበሳ! ወይዘሪት ብዃሪያ ጫማ ብዝግባእ ምስራሕ ትኽእል እያ\" ኢሉ ገለፀሉ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ff9f74fd5f495320849b90882547af8f454f32a14bd0c2066aa59d445bad242b"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25722.png",
      "text": "ኣያ ኣንበሳ ፣\" በሉ ሕዚ ንብዃሪያ ፀውዑለይ\" በሎም፡፡ ወዓግን ዝብእን ድማ ንብዃሪያ ፀዊዖም ኣምፅእዋ፡፡ ኣያ ኣንበሳ ድማ ጫማ ክትሰርሐሉ ኣዘዘ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:697d57bb01f592826c28a908a4e4eb57adca442693e7ba6dac55397ef50e1b43"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25723.png",
      "text": "ብዃሪያ ትእዛዝ ኣንበሳ ድሕሪ ምቅባል ብሚስጢር ከምዚ ኢላ ኣዘራረበቶ ፣ \"እሞ ዝበለፀ ጫማ ዝስራሕ ካብ ናይ ወዓግን ዝብእን ቆርበት ምዃኑ ኸ ትፈልጥ ዶ?\" በለቶ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:009119ebfd189644caa13ab9e4fe964bc023f595bd1cd69e40f4af7630137f88"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25724.png",
      "text": "ኣያ ኣንበሳ ድማ ዝበለፀ ጫማ ክትሰርሓሉ ብምሕሳብ \"ጥራሕ ስርሕለይ እምበር ከምፃኣልኪ እየ በላ፡፡ ከየዱ ድማ ንወዓግን ዝብእን ቀቲሉ ፣ ቆርበቶም ገፊፉ፣ኣምፂኡ፣ ኣረከባ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e5a462b08a216f977c9816fc14d107823479d31ec79c6232e0020238873b1d53"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25725.png",
      "text": "ብዃሪያ ንኣያ ኣንበሳ እንተዘይሰሪሓትሉ ከም ዝቐትላ ስለ እትፈልጥ ፈርሐት፤ ተንኮል ድማ ሓሰበት ፡፡ እቲ ቆርበት ድማ ናብ ዓብዪ ቃላይ ወሲዳ ኣጥለቐቶ፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:30da9d89b1aa37f5ecd9e495211ca4fc8cc5ab0f5cc4a9bb8da55fe3109b0636"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25726.png",
      "text": "ኣያ ኣንበሳ እቲ ጫማ ዘንጊዒኽኒ ኢሉ ኣፈራርሓ ፡፡ እቲ ቆርበት ምእንቲ ክልስልስ ናብ ቃላይ ከም ዘእተወቶ ፣ ሕዚ ግና ከይዳ ከምፆኦ እየ ኢላ መለሰትሉ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:fe3c968902826d470bfad421f38b2dfd1bd206d8f70dd9436d0a6b092b0cc36c"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25727.png",
      "text": "ብዃሪያ ናብቲ ሩባ ከይዳ ድሕሪ ዝተወሰነ ግዘ ናብ ኣንበሳ ተመለሰት ፡፡ ብምቅፃል ፣ \"ኣብቲ ውሽጢ ቃላይ ንዓኻ ዝመስል ኣንበሳ እቲ ቆርበት ከይወስዶ ከሊኡኒ፣ ጥርሐይ ተመሊሰ\" በለቶ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:3e579c478ca93b814c518958b2135472acd7ac0172e614265b7a0c662ea9460a"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25728.png",
      "text": "ኣያ ኣንበሳ ብቑጠዐ ምስ ብዃሪያ ናብቲ ወሰን ቃላይ እናጎየየ ከደ ፡፡ ኣብ ውሽጢ ቃላይ ነፀብራቕ ምስሉ ረኣየ፡፡ ዘሊሉ ክጎብጦ ብምሕሳብ ናብቲ ቃላይ ኣትዩ ተሰርኒቑ ሞተ ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22015#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a0cafbc65e2e2fd03cbd01f6aab06d08f6aad2d431119836104f9a88ec69ef3c"
    }
  ],
